  "title": "rsa: Use proper free function",
  "description": "gnutls_x509_privkey_export_rsa_raw() allocates buffers with\ngnutls_malloc() and they must be freed with gnutls_free().\nA Windows debug build can complain about this due to the\npossibility of the library being linked with a different\nruntime library than the main application.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
